{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"1945年3月10日，38万1300发集束炸弹落在了东京。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当时日本的房屋几乎都是木造的。仅仅这一天，东京就有三分之一被烧毁。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我母亲在这场空袭中失去了家人和家园。于是她投奔住在横须贺的表姐，搬到了那里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"B-29此后仍毫不留情地焚毁日本的主要城市。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到了8月，广岛和长崎遭到原子弹轰炸。日本终于向美国投降了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"从那以后，横须贺挤满了占领军的美国士兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"母亲当时才十五六岁，表姐教她怎么在这座城市活下去——做美国兵的生意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"母亲就是在那里认识了父亲。然后，才有了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"父亲是个军官，在<R=盟军最高司令官总司令部,GHQ>的<R=参谋部民政局,GS>工作，隶属惠特尼准将。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=盟军最高司令官总司令部,GHQ> <R=参谋部民政局,GS>","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"他是在那个被称为麦克阿瑟分身的人手下工作。父亲的职位大概也不低。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"AUX_CAUSAL_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"听说父亲在日本时把母亲当妻子一样对待，可回到美国以后，就再也没有联系。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我出生时，父亲已经回美国了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"母亲一个人把我养大。她用父亲留下的那点钱开了家店，向占领军卖香烟之类的东西。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"日子和普通人差不多。但我没有国籍。如今虽然也在推动改革，可在日本，如果不知道父亲是谁，就拿不到户籍。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":150,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"所以我看着街上的美国兵，一遍遍告诉自己。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我是胜利者——美国的孩子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我的头发和眼睛，都和那些瘦削、低着头的日本人不一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"总有一天，我要离开这个国家，回到真正的祖国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"大概十岁的时候，母亲身体出了问题，店里已经基本都交给我看着了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"就在那时，我从店里抽屉深处找到了一张父亲的照片，仅此一张。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"我把父亲的照片拿给经常出入店里的美国人看。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"就这样过了几年，终于有个美国人告诉了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"「那家伙是Miller，我认识。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"我又去问别人：「Miller现在在哪？」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"「能不能告诉我，那个叫Miller的军官现在在哪？」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"AUX_COLONEL_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"听说父亲已经退役，住在弗吉尼亚，靠给士兵当教官为生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"告诉我这些的，正是父亲的学生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"我用英语写了封信：「我是你的儿子，我想去美国。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"我每天等。等到都快等累了，邮差终于把未来送来了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"父亲寄来了钱。我以为自己的梦想终于要实现了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"那时的我眼里只有自己。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"于是，我让卧床不起的母亲亲口对我说了句「去吧」。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"父亲安排的漆黑轿车来接我。那些一直嘲笑我发色的邻居们，全都瞪大眼睛看着我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"AUX_NEIGHBOR_NARROWING_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"我把母亲送进医院，然后独自去了美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"第一次见到父亲时，他一个人住在一栋很大的房子里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"听说他的儿子……那个美国儿子，死在了越南。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"他给我看了照片。那就是我的哥哥。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"大概是儿子死了，又赶上离婚，父亲太寂寞了吧……所以才会对我这种人产生兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"父亲已经不当讲师了。他弓着背，也很少活动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"不过，他给了我Miller这个姓，还有上学的钱。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"我用那笔钱学了英语，也读完了大学。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"美国已经被旷日持久的越南战争拖得筋疲力尽。一边在国外打仗，一边又在国内高喊和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"一毕业，我就独自回了日本。因为父亲拒绝见母亲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"久别重逢的母亲连看都不看我。起初我还以为她在生我的气。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"但不是。病菌已经侵蚀了她的大脑。是年轻时乱来留下的病。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"母亲已经不知道我是谁了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"我告诉她自己的名字：「妈，是我，Kazuhira。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"就在那一刻，我听见自己的声音，猛地一怔。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"“和平（Kazuhira）”。这是母亲给我取的名字，在日语里意为“和平”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"我是日本人。至少，我是这个瘦小日本女人的儿子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"直到这时，我才第一次明白母亲为什么给我这个名字，也明白了她寄托其中的心愿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"母亲的故乡和家人都被战火烧毁，身心也都遭到战争侵蚀……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":52,"cn_text":"她却想和昔日的敌人生下一个名叫“和平”的孩子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":53,"cn_text":"日本输掉了战争。但拿战争当衡量尺度，又有什么价值？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":54,"cn_text":"直到去年的石油危机，战后日本经济一直在增长。这个国家正试图变得更强。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":55,"cn_text":"我留在了日本，加入自卫队。那年我22岁。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":56,"cn_text":"为了治疗费和生活……话虽如此，工作明明有的是。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":57,"cn_text":"明明知道这一点，我却还是想不到别的路可走。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":58,"cn_text":"两年后，治疗费再也不需要了。母亲去世了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":59,"cn_text":"我离开自卫队，再次回到了美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":60,"cn_text":"父亲已经躺在坟墓里了。听说他朝自己脑袋开了一枪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":61,"cn_text":"美国战胜了日本。可父亲却输给了美国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":62,"cn_text":"美国梦结束了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":63,"cn_text":"之后我就随波逐流了。再后面的事，你也知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":64,"cn_text":"……GHQ造就了像母亲那样的女人，造就了日本的和平宪法和自卫队，也造就了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":65,"cn_text":"我是因战争而生的。但我不想死在战争里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":66,"cn_text":"我不想因为国家的缘故去死，也不愿贫穷地活着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":67,"cn_text":"我也不想让户籍或出身决定自己的命运。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":68,"cn_text":"Boss，跟着你，我觉得自己就不会落到那种下场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""}]}